%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0ca23d3e41cd5424c9ec72c610ef25a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: TrapOdahviing
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988090927316992
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: The barracks should be right through here.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988090927316993
    - rid: 4927988090927316994
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988090927316995
    - rid: 4927988090927316996
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 89f7d0b97106b6448939eb57dd9aa235, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh, hello captain. Anything to report to us?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988090927316997
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah. Are there any other guards here who are currently off-duty?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988090927316998
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 89f7d0b97106b6448939eb57dd9aa235, type: 2}
    dialog: Ilgand and Gertrude are currently patrolling the dungeon and everyone
      else is out on patrol, why?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988090927316999
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Do we need two guards specifically, {mc}?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988090927317000
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: (The mechanism definitely requires two people to operate, but I guess
      there isn't anything stopping you from being the other person.)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Is it complicated or something?)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: (Nah, I'm pretty sure it's just two chains you gotta pull at the same
      time.)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: That's fine, but you need to come with us.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988090927317001
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 89f7d0b97106b6448939eb57dd9aa235, type: 2}
    dialog: What's the matter? Brigands? Bandits? Lost sweetroll?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Nope!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988090927317002
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: We're gonna catch a dragon.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988090927317004
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 89f7d0b97106b6448939eb57dd9aa235, type: 2}
    dialog: I...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988090927317012
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 89f7d0b97106b6448939eb57dd9aa235, type: 2}
    dialog: Wha-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988090927317005
    - rid: 4927988090927317013
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 89f7d0b97106b6448939eb57dd9aa235, type: 2}
    dialog: Why-?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 89f7d0b97106b6448939eb57dd9aa235, type: 2}
    dialog: How?!?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988090927317006
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: A dragon, to save the world, and with a trap up on the balcony of Dragonsreach.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988090927317008
    - rid: 4927988090927317014
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 89f7d0b97106b6448939eb57dd9aa235, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988090927317009
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 89f7d0b97106b6448939eb57dd9aa235, type: 2}
    dialog: We're luring a dragon into <i>our</i> city?!? That's a horrible idea-!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988090927317010
    - rid: 4927988090927317015
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: It's not as bad of an idea as you think.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988090927317011
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Do you know where the Jarl got the dragon skull that's above his throne?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 89f7d0b97106b6448939eb57dd9aa235, type: 2}
    dialog: Hm. Long ago, Olaf One-Eye killed a dragon; that's where we got it from,
      right?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: That's partially true.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: The key to killing Numinex, the dragon, was a trap that was built in
      the balcony of Dragonsreach.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ... You can see where I'm going with this, yeah?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 89f7d0b97106b6448939eb57dd9aa235, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, there's no way the Jarl would be willing to risk this, even if
      it would work.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 89f7d0b97106b6448939eb57dd9aa235, type: 2}
    dialog: Not while we are under threat of being attacked due to the civil war-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Has Balgruuf received an axe from Ulfric?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (An axe, {mc}?)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: (It's an old Nord tradition, it's a sign of peace to give someone your
      axe.)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: (If the other person keeps the axe, it's basically a non-aggression pact.)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: (If you give the axe back, it can be taken as a sign of war.)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 89f7d0b97106b6448939eb57dd9aa235, type: 2}
    dialog: Not that I'm aware of, no.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Then there's nothing to worry about.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: As of now, Jarl Balgruuf is leaning toward the Imperial side.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Only barely, of course, he doesn't support them enough to join the conflict
      proper.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Regardless, since he hasn't joined the fight, Ulfric would rather pursue
      diplomacy first rather than waste men.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: So, as long as Ulfric hasn't sent an axe, you don't need to allocate
      any resources to the civil war.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 89f7d0b97106b6448939eb57dd9aa235, type: 2}
    dialog: Uhh...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 89f7d0b97106b6448939eb57dd9aa235, type: 2}
    dialog: Even so, we should still tell the Jarl about this-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: No, no, no, we don't need to do that, uh-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988271059042304
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: We've already talked to him and he told us it was fine.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988271059042305
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 89f7d0b97106b6448939eb57dd9aa235, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh. I see.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988271059042306
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 89f7d0b97106b6448939eb57dd9aa235, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, in that case, let's get a look at this trap.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988271059042307
    - rid: 4927988271059042308
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5301facf4ef9bfe46bdb4745494365d2, type: 2}
    dialog: Ah, you've returned!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988271059042309
    - rid: 4927988271059042310
    - rid: 4927988271059042311
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5301facf4ef9bfe46bdb4745494365d2, type: 2}
    dialog: We are in your debt for-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: For taking care of that dragon, yeah, yeah.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Please excuse me, the three of us really have some urgent business.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5301facf4ef9bfe46bdb4745494365d2, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, if Monika's with you I should stay out of your way.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5301facf4ef9bfe46bdb4745494365d2, type: 2}
    dialog: I'll be expecting a report when you're finished, of course.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Aye aye, captain!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988271059042312
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ... I can't hear you!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988271059042313
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988271059042314
    - rid: 4927988271059042315
    - rid: 4927988271059042317
    - rid: 4927988271059042318
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 89f7d0b97106b6448939eb57dd9aa235, type: 2}
    dialog: So what exactly is this dragon-trap?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I lead the two of them up the stairs directly to the right of the balcony
      door.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: You see that big yoke up in the ceiling?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988271059042319
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I point up, showing the yoke to Monika and the guard.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Basically, we pull on these pull-bars and drop it on the neck of the
      dragon.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 89f7d0b97106b6448939eb57dd9aa235, type: 2}
    dialog: So, why am I here?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Because directly across from us is the second pull-bar.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: They need to be pulled at the same time to drop the yoke.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 89f7d0b97106b6448939eb57dd9aa235, type: 2}
    dialog: Ah.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: We should test it to make sure it works, retracting should operate the
      same way.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 'The guard stays at the pull-bar, while Monika and I walk around to the
      other one. '
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988271059042320
    - rid: 4927988271059042321
    - rid: 4927988271059042322
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Can you hear me from over here?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 89f7d0b97106b6448939eb57dd9aa235, type: 2}
    dialog: Yep!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Alright, I'll do a countdown from three, and we'll pull on go, okay?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Okay!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: 3...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988271059042323
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: 2...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: 1...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Go!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: The two of them pull at the same time, dropping the yoke down from above.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988271059042324
    - rid: 4927988271059042325
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Whoa!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Good, it works.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988271059042326
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I won't be able to give you guys a countdown when we're trapping the
      dragon, so you should probably coordinate among yourselves.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: We meet back up by the dropped yoke.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988271059042327
    - rid: 4927988271059042329
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I know you have, Monika, but have <i>you</i> seen a dragon before?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988271059042330
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 89f7d0b97106b6448939eb57dd9aa235, type: 2}
    dialog: Ah, well... no.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988271059042331
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Darn.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, the important thing to be aware of, is that we're trying to get
      this yoke around its neck.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988271059042332
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I grab some handfuls of hay that's lying around-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Wait, why is there hay up here?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Anyway, I spread the hay around just underneath the yoke.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: So we want to activate the mechanism when the neck will be directly above
      this hay.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Hopefully the kerfuffle with Odahviing doesn't knock it around...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Dragon necks are pretty long, so it shouldn't be <i>too</i> hard.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: But we don't want to drop the yoke too early, since it'd probably get
      caught on its horns or something-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Meaning the dragon won't be secured.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Which, I'm pretty sure I don't need to tell you, is bad.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988296190787584
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Let's pull the yoke up for now, so we can nab that there dragon.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988296190787585
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: As instructed, Monika and the guard get back to their posts, pulling
      the yoke back up.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988296190787587
    - rid: 4927988296190787589
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 89f7d0b97106b6448939eb57dd9aa235, type: 2}
    dialog: Uh, captain, can we run through the timing of this thing a few more times?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988296190787590
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: We should be able to... right, {mc}?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988296190787591
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: That's fine, the dragon'll only come when I challenge it, so you guys
      can practice as much as you want.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988296190787592
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: The two of them do a couple of reps of yanking their chains.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988296190787593
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Isn't that a euphemism-?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: We're ready, {mc}!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988296190787595
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Huh-?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988296190787596
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh, yeah.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Alright, I'm gonna summon the dragon.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I'll try to bait him in; you two should be safe up there.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I make my way to the outside portion of the balcony.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988296190787597
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: <font=dragonfont>od 4 v3ng</font>!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988296190787598
    - rid: 4927988296190787599
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ... moment of truth...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 89f7d0b97106b6448939eb57dd9aa235, type: 2}
    dialog: Did the dragon make that sound?!?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988296190787600
    - rid: 4927988296190787602
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Yep. It should be flying by any minute...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: As expected, after a few seconds, Odahviing comes flying into view, circling
      over me.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Lucky me that worked!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I don't remember if I need to use dragonrend or not, but I might as well.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Better safe than sorry!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: <font=dragonfont>j8r z4 frul</font>!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988296190787603
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Flying lizard successfully struck by blue wave of entropic infusion.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Odahviing crashes down onto the balcony.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988296190787604
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d0c7e6e02081ef145a5f9d29590789ea, type: 2}
    dialog: What manner of thu'um was that?!?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988296190787605
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: What, you didn't fight the ancient Nords?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d0c7e6e02081ef145a5f9d29590789ea, type: 2}
    dialog: No matter! The open skies aren't my only advantage over your puny mortal
      body!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Then come get me, you pathetic excuse of a dov!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d0c7e6e02081ef145a5f9d29590789ea, type: 2}
    dialog: How dare you!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988296190787661
    - rid: 4927988296190787662
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988296190787659
    - rid: 4927988296190787665
    - rid: 4927988296190787666
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988296190787660
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988296190787663
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988296190787664
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Now!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988296190787667
    - rid: 4927988296190787668
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988296190787669
    - rid: 4927988296190787670
    - rid: 4927988296190787671
    - rid: 4927988319496175616
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Phew!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Dragon successfully snared...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988319496175617
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d0c7e6e02081ef145a5f9d29590789ea, type: 2}
    dialog: Gah!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d0c7e6e02081ef145a5f9d29590789ea, type: 2}
    dialog: Zu'u bonaar... you went through a great deal to put me in this...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d0c7e6e02081ef145a5f9d29590789ea, type: 2}
    dialog: Humiliating position.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d0c7e6e02081ef145a5f9d29590789ea, type: 2}
    dialog: Hind siiv Alduin. No doubt you want to know where to find Alduin?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Nah, I already know he went through his portal to Sovngarde at Skuldafn.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d0c7e6e02081ef145a5f9d29590789ea, type: 2}
    dialog: Ah...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: 'I''ll keep this brief:'
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I've outsmarted and trapped you; you are at my mercy.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: If we actually fought for real, I'd probably win-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Alduin fled to Sovngarde with his tail between his legs after fighting
      me, of course.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: So... I'll let you out of this thing if you do me a favor.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d0c7e6e02081ef145a5f9d29590789ea, type: 2}
    dialog: You wish to bargain with a Dov?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: A bargain implies an equal exchange, it'd be more accurate to say I'm
      <i>coercing</i> a Dov.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d0c7e6e02081ef145a5f9d29590789ea, type: 2}
    dialog: ... what is this favor?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: 'It''s twofold:'
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: First, you're going to fly me to Skuldafn, so I can go defeat Alduin.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Second, you're going to avoid rampaging across Skyrim, especially against
      the people of this hold.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988319496175618
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d0c7e6e02081ef145a5f9d29590789ea, type: 2}
    dialog: That second point is to forfeit my very nature!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: The dragon's will to dominate in general, or your personal desire to
      hunt?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d0c7e6e02081ef145a5f9d29590789ea, type: 2}
    dialog: My desire to hunt, to nir?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: It's literally in your name? "Ah" means hunter, right?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d0c7e6e02081ef145a5f9d29590789ea, type: 2}
    dialog: You are well acquainted with our culture, Dovahkiin.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I get that a lot.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Anyway, townsfolk aren't really good prey, so ignoring them would hardly
      be a loss on your end-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Actually, you know what?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: If you ever feel the need to get some violence in, you could head down
      to the Summerset Isles, way down in the southwest.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: So, do we have an agreement?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d0c7e6e02081ef145a5f9d29590789ea, type: 2}
    dialog: Fine.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d0c7e6e02081ef145a5f9d29590789ea, type: 2}
    dialog: Be quick about it.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Nice.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Alright, you two! You can let him go!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988319496175619
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 89f7d0b97106b6448939eb57dd9aa235, type: 2}
    dialog: ARE YOU CRAZY?!?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988319496175621
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Nope!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: There's nothing to worry about, Odahviing promises to not burn this whole
      place to the ground, right Odahviing?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d0c7e6e02081ef145a5f9d29590789ea, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: ... {mc}?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d0c7e6e02081ef145a5f9d29590789ea, type: 2}
    dialog: I promise not to <i>burn</i> this place to the ground.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988319496175623
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: 'I noticed that deliberate emphasis on "burn." '
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: If there's some dragon-sized damage here by the time I'm done with Alduin,
      I will eat your soul.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d0c7e6e02081ef145a5f9d29590789ea, type: 2}
    dialog: ... whatever. <i>Munax Qahnaarin</i>...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988319496175624
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: If you say so...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: The two pull the yoke back up, releasing Odahviing.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988319496175622
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d0c7e6e02081ef145a5f9d29590789ea, type: 2}
    dialog: Saraan uth...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d0c7e6e02081ef145a5f9d29590789ea, type: 2}
    dialog: I shall take you to Skuldafn as promised.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d0c7e6e02081ef145a5f9d29590789ea, type: 2}
    dialog: Are you ready to see the world, only as a Dovah can-?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e66ba0c6207b7664dbb0b977115f10b2, type: 2}
    dialog: What in Oblivion is all this racket-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988319496175625
    - rid: 4927988319496175626
    - rid: 4927988319496175627
    - rid: 4927988319496175628
    - rid: 4927988319496175629
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e66ba0c6207b7664dbb0b977115f10b2, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988319496175630
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 89f7d0b97106b6448939eb57dd9aa235, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Well, I guess that cat's out of the bag!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Yep, I'm ready to go!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988319496175631
    - rid: 4927988319496175632
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I hop onto Odahviing's neck, grabbing onto his horns, almost like I'm
      riding a motorcycle.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e66ba0c6207b7664dbb0b977115f10b2, type: 2}
    dialog: Monika...!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d0c7e6e02081ef145a5f9d29590789ea, type: 2}
    dialog: Zok brit uth!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988319496175634
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d0c7e6e02081ef145a5f9d29590789ea, type: 2}
    dialog: I warn you, once you've flown the skies of Keizaal, your envy of the
      Dov will only increase.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: '{mc} flies away on Odahviing to Skuldafn.'
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e66ba0c6207b7664dbb0b977115f10b2, type: 2}
    dialog: What manner of madness has claimed you; a dragon in Dragonsreach and
      you only had two men with you to fight it?!?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988319496175635
    - rid: 4927988319496175636
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, in our defense, the plan wasn't to fight it, but catch it.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988319496175637
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e66ba0c6207b7664dbb0b977115f10b2, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e66ba0c6207b7664dbb0b977115f10b2, type: 2}
    dialog: That is somehow <i>MORE</i> stupid!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988362429071360
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: ... It worked, didn't it?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988362429071361
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e66ba0c6207b7664dbb0b977115f10b2, type: 2}
    dialog: ... We're going to be speaking to the Jarl about this.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988362429071362
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 89f7d0b97106b6448939eb57dd9aa235, type: 2}
    dialog: I thought you said you already talked to him!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: ({mc}, when you get back, I'm gonna get you back for leaving me to deal
      with this alone!)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988362429071364
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988362429071365
    - rid: 4927988362429071366
    - rid: 4927988362429071367
    - rid: 4927988362429071368
    - rid: 4927988362429071371
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e66ba0c6207b7664dbb0b977115f10b2, type: 2}
    dialog: My Jarl, Monika trapped a dragon up in the balcony with the Dragonborn
      and let it go free!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988362429071373
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5301facf4ef9bfe46bdb4745494365d2, type: 2}
    dialog: Wha-?!?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5301facf4ef9bfe46bdb4745494365d2, type: 2}
    dialog: By Ysmir, are you insane?!?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5301facf4ef9bfe46bdb4745494365d2, type: 2}
    dialog: And <i>you</i>, you were helping her with this... foolishness?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 89f7d0b97106b6448939eb57dd9aa235, type: 2}
    dialog: I was told that you had already given approval for this, my lord.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 89f7d0b97106b6448939eb57dd9aa235, type: 2}
    dialog: I was just following my orders.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5301facf4ef9bfe46bdb4745494365d2, type: 2}
    dialog: For what possible reason could you justify risking all of our lives like
      that!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: To save the world.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988362429071374
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Balgruuf narrows his eyes in contempt.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988362429071375
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5301facf4ef9bfe46bdb4745494365d2, type: 2}
    dialog: You have committed what was tantamount to treason to... save the world.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988362429071376
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: To defeat Alduin, {mc} needed the help of another dragon to get to where
      he is.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Which, to my understanding, is where he's flying to now.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Balgruuf leans forward from his throne, putting his head in his hands.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988362429071377
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5301facf4ef9bfe46bdb4745494365d2, type: 2}
    dialog: Monika, just...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Balgruuf leans back up, facing Monika.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5301facf4ef9bfe46bdb4745494365d2, type: 2}
    dialog: Just go out on patrol.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Of course.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988362429071438
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988362429071430
    - rid: 4927988362429071431
    - rid: 4927988362429071432
    - rid: 4927988362429071433
    - rid: 4927988362429071434
    - rid: 4927988362429071439
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Huh. That went better than I thought it would.)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (...)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Why are <b>you</b> still here?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988362429071435
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Not that I'm complaining or anything-)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988362429071436
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (I just figured you'd probably be helping {mc} with whatever he's doing.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988362429071437
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (...)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Oh, what the heck, it doesn't matter; I get to talk to <b>you</b>!)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988362429071440
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988362429071441
    - rid: 4927988362429071442
    - rid: 4927988362429071443
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (So...)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Do you play an instrument?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988362429071445
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions: []
  playerChoices:
  - choiceText: Yep!
    resultingSequence: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c31e0726b949a4746b4a534960b9705e, type: 2}
    conditions: []
  - choiceText: I used to.
    resultingSequence: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 57f2b9a33dc1d554681a37257ce502c7, type: 2}
    conditions: []
  - choiceText: No, I never have.
    resultingSequence: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 328f12cf0f6050a409b145e68a76f259, type: 2}
    conditions: []
  - choiceText: Why do you ask?
    resultingSequence: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 93582ea3e8233ed409971dfc14feef97, type: 2}
    conditions: []
